          "kind": "",
          "text": "**2026-10-19** — From S02 (2026-10-19): clirun kills the process group only on timeout or cancel; a grandchild still holding stdout after a normal exit makes Run wait 2 s and return a generic error. Also encode Snapshot part errors as {code,message} over the socket so ToolError codes survive.",
