          "text": "**2026-10-19** — Review notes: docs/design.md says the pidfile is never read empty, not true for a brand-new pidfile before its first write (refusal message lacks the pid); ipc.go:103 says macOS limits on every platform; the cli suite takes about 40 s under -race. Proposed and awaiting owner: doctor does not fail on missing vendor CLIs; needs_you = open adj records; projects add accepts a path that does not exist.",
